    They turned and set off towards home, but Jaromir looked back over his shoulder several times. Once it seemed to him that the spiral on the pine was longer than before – that it now reached higher than it had when they were looking at it. He decided it was only his eyes playing tricks on him. # pokaz: spirala # dalej
